+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen for its memory-hard design, which makes GPU-based brute-force and offline cracking attacks substantially more costly, strengthening the security posture of password storage. No specific parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
